// 06_LevelCalculation.ino
// ============================================================
// PURPOSE:
// Water Level Calculation and Calibration Table Interpolation Tab.
//
// RESPONSIBILITIES:
// 1. Maintain 201-point empirical calibration table (0..200 cm liquid height).
// 2. Perform piecewise linear interpolation of ADC offset against the calibration table.
// 3. Apply low-level deadband filtering (0.5 cm) and clamp height between 0 cm and 200 cm.
// 4. Provide linear fallback calculation if reading exceeds calibration lookup boundaries.
//
// USED BY:
// - SensorTask (computes liquid level from filtered ADC value)
// - BLE (SHOW_LEVEL command displays calculated height)
// ============================================================

